1
00:00:00,747 --> 00:00:03,127
(Howard:)How about a hug for Howie?

2
00:00:03,292 --> 00:00:06,502
(Penny:)Sure. Raj, hug Howard.

3
00:00:07,963 --> 00:00:09,463
[SHELDON SIGHS]

4
00:00:10,716 --> 00:00:12,216
(Leonard:)Something you'd like to share?

5
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,640
A tale of woe perhaps?

6
00:00:16,138 --> 00:00:17,468
(Gablehouser:)Fifteen years old.

7
00:00:17,639 --> 00:00:21,479
Dennis Kim is 15 years old
and he's already correcting my work.

8
00:00:21,643 --> 00:00:25,523
(Sheldon:)Today, I went from being
Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart to...

9
00:00:25,689 --> 00:00:27,109
(Sheldon:)You know, that other guy.

10
00:00:27,274 --> 00:00:28,404
(Howard:)Antonio Salieri?

11
00:00:29,234 --> 00:00:31,904
(Sheldon:)Oh, God,
now even you're smarter than me.

12
00:00:33,113 --> 00:00:37,493
You know, you don't have so many friends
that you can afford to start insulting them.

13
00:00:38,618 --> 00:00:40,498
(Leonard:)Just eat, Sheldon. You'll feel better.

14
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:41,912
Why waste food?

15
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:44,460
(Sheldon:)When a cow goes dry,
they don't keep feeding it...

16
00:00:44,624 --> 00:00:47,964
(Sheldon:)...they just take her out
and shoot her between the eyes.

17
00:00:48,378 --> 00:00:52,178
(Penny:)I'm confused.
Did Sheldon stop giving milk?

18
00:00:52,924 --> 00:00:54,634
(Leonard:)You can't let this kid get to you.

19
00:00:54,801 --> 00:00:58,261
You knew that someday, someone would
come along who's younger and smarter.

20
00:00:58,430 --> 00:01:01,100
(Sheldon:)Yes, but I assumed
I would've been dead hundreds of years.

